<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="/css/style.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <title>後台 - 儀表板</title>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/nav') %>
  <div class="container mt-5">
    <h2 class="text-center text-white">後台管理 - 儀表板</h2>
    <p class="text-center text-white">歡迎，<%= username %>！您正在使用後台管理系統。</p>
    <div class="row mt-4">
      <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
        <div class="card bg-dark text-white">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">用戶管理</h5>
            <p class="card-text">管理網站用戶，設置角色（普通用戶或管理員）。</p>
            <a href="/admin/users" class="btn btn-primary">前往</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
        <div class="card bg-dark text-white">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">內容管理</h5>
            <p class="card-text">審核和管理用戶的任務、檔案和生字庫。</p>
            <a href="/admin/tasks" class="btn btn-primary">前往任務</a>
            <a href="/admin/files" class="btn btn-primary mt-2">前往檔案</a>
            <a href="/admin/dictation" class="btn btn-primary mt-2">前往生字</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
        <div class="card bg-dark text-white">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">系統設定</h5>
            <p class="card-text">管理站點標題、推送通知和其他全局設定。</p>
            <a href="/admin/settings" class="btn btn-primary">前往</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
        <div class="card bg-dark text-white">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">SEO管理</h5>
            <p class="card-text">優化網站的SEO設置，提升搜尋引擎排名。</p>
            <a href="/admin/seo" class="btn btn-primary">前往</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
        <div class="card bg-dark text-white">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">日誌查看</h5>
            <p class="card-text">查看系統操作日誌，追蹤後台活動。</p>
            <a href="/admin/logs" class="btn btn-primary">前往</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>